{
    "title": "Pyramid Solitaire - Card Games",
    "description": "Looking for a classic card game to play? Look no further than <b>Pyramid Solitaire</b> by MobilityWare - the original Free Pyramid Solitaire game for Android devices.\r\n\r\nThis game has been re-imagined and is now better than ever. It's a puzzle game that requires logic and strategy to clear the table.\r\n\r\nFree Pyramid Solitaire is a game you can play to challenge your brain and have fun solving each Daily Challenge to receive a crown for that day. With its unique winnable deal, the Daily Challenge lets you earn Jeweled Crowns and Trophies and compete with other players on the Leaderboard. Each new day unlocks a new Daily Challenge deal. You can access each challenge by simply clicking on the Play Menu button.\r\n\r\nIf you like the fast-paced game of Tri Peaks, you will love Pyramid Solitaire. Similar to TriPeaks, this puzzle game is always new and challenging. Enjoy its new saga journey and collect unique badges while completing challenges. You will always have new challenges to train your brain and develop your skills! Play unlimited daily games for a unique and challenging Solitaire for free. The game's challenge never gets too great, but beware\u2014you must still find the right moves to beat the challenge!\r\n\r\nPlay the Tut's Tomb game you remember and enjoy a classic Solitaire experience. It offers thousands of randomized deals, fun and exciting animations, and smooth and polished gameplay. Forget about those old bicycle cards and dive into Pyramid Solitaire mobile gameplay.\r\n\r\nPYRAMID SOLITAIRE BY MOBILITYWARE FEATURES:\r\n\r\nPlay the Classic Game of Pyramid Solitaire or Tut's Tomb You Know and Love!\r\n\r\n- Winning Deals: Never let the game's challenge get too great! But beware, you must still find the right moves to beat the challenge!\r\n\r\nTry the unique solitaire challenges to train your brain with this classic game of Pyramid Solitaire, also known as the 13 card game.\r\n\r\n- Explore the enhanced Pyramid Solitaire saga map and immerse yourself in the adventurous expedition mode. \r\n- Collect your weekly badges, gems, and puzzle pieces for new backgrounds!\r\n\r\nExercise Your Brain by Playing Challenging Card Games & Unlock New Challenges Each Day!\r\n\r\n- New challenges keep the classic Solitaire game of Pyramid fresh every time.\r\n- Always FREE! - Play unlimited daily card games for fun, unique, and challenging games!\r\n\r\nClassic Games, Modern Options!\r\n\r\n- Statistics Tracker: Track your progress across your Pyramid games to develop new strategies for overcoming the Pyramid puzzle!\r\n- Customize card faces and play fields to make the game of Tut's Tomb your own!\r\n- Play online or take the challenge offline with random deals. No WIFI required to play anywhere for free!\r\n- Use unlimited Undos and hints to find the way through the puzzle of Tut's Tomb\r\n- Remove the Menu and Status bar to make navigation easier on Devices that utilize Android's Navigation Bar (requires Android 4.4 or above)\r\n- Train your brain and have fun solving each Daily Challenge to receive a crown for that day. \r\n- Earn trophies each month by winning more crowns! Play our daily challenges in Pyramid Solitaire for free!\r\n\r\n<b>How to Play Pyramid Solitaire Classic FREE Card Game:</b>\r\nPair cards that equal to 13. Jacks = 11, Queens = 12, and Kings = 13. Combine cards totaling 13 to remove them from the board. Use the draw pile to help you find the cards you need. Clear the board to win the game!\r\n\r\nChallenge yourself to reach the top of the Pyramid and clear as many Solitaire boards as possible. Train your brain with this classic Klondike card game. Whether you call it 13 card game, Piramid or Pyramid, it's our outstanding game that continues to attract millions.\r\nDownload Pyramid Solitaire by MobilityWare now to play the best and most popular Solitaire card game today!\r\n\r\nTry other card games from our MobilityWare Solitaire Collection: Crown, Castle, Addiction, Spider, FreeCell, TriPeaks Solitaire, and the classic Klondike Solitaire.\r\nhttps://www.mobilityware.com/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a classic card game to play? Look no further than <b>Pyramid Solitaire</b> by MobilityWare - the original Free Pyramid Solitaire game for Android devices.<br><br>This game has been re-imagined and is now better than ever. It&#39;s a puzzle game that requires logic and strategy to clear the table.<br><br>Free Pyramid Solitaire is a game you can play to challenge your brain and have fun solving each Daily Challenge to receive a crown for that day. With its unique winnable deal, the Daily Challenge lets you earn Jeweled Crowns and Trophies and compete with other players on the Leaderboard. Each new day unlocks a new Daily Challenge deal. You can access each challenge by simply clicking on the Play Menu button.<br><br>If you like the fast-paced game of Tri Peaks, you will love Pyramid Solitaire. Similar to TriPeaks, this puzzle game is always new and challenging. Enjoy its new saga journey and collect unique badges while completing challenges. You will always have new challenges to train your brain and develop your skills! Play unlimited daily games for a unique and challenging Solitaire for free. The game&#39;s challenge never gets too great, but beware\u2014you must still find the right moves to beat the challenge!<br><br>Play the Tut&#39;s Tomb game you remember and enjoy a classic Solitaire experience. It offers thousands of randomized deals, fun and exciting animations, and smooth and polished gameplay. Forget about those old bicycle cards and dive into Pyramid Solitaire mobile gameplay.<br><br>PYRAMID SOLITAIRE BY MOBILITYWARE FEATURES:<br><br>Play the Classic Game of Pyramid Solitaire or Tut&#39;s Tomb You Know and Love!<br><br>- Winning Deals: Never let the game&#39;s challenge get too great! But beware, you must still find the right moves to beat the challenge!<br><br>Try the unique solitaire challenges to train your brain with this classic game of Pyramid Solitaire, also known as the 13 card game.<br><br>- Explore the enhanced Pyramid Solitaire saga map and immerse yourself in the adventurous expedition mode. <br>- Collect your weekly badges, gems, and puzzle pieces for new backgrounds!<br><br>Exercise Your Brain by Playing Challenging Card Games &amp; Unlock New Challenges Each Day!<br><br>- New challenges keep the classic Solitaire game of Pyramid fresh every time.<br>- Always FREE! - Play unlimited daily card games for fun, unique, and challenging games!<br><br>Classic Games, Modern Options!<br><br>- Statistics Tracker: Track your progress across your Pyramid games to develop new strategies for overcoming the Pyramid puzzle!<br>- Customize card faces and play fields to make the game of Tut&#39;s Tomb your own!<br>- Play online or take the challenge offline with random deals. No WIFI required to play anywhere for free!<br>- Use unlimited Undos and hints to find the way through the puzzle of Tut&#39;s Tomb<br>- Remove the Menu and Status bar to make navigation easier on Devices that utilize Android&#39;s Navigation Bar (requires Android 4.4 or above)<br>- Train your brain and have fun solving each Daily Challenge to receive a crown for that day. <br>- Earn trophies each month by winning more crowns! Play our daily challenges in Pyramid Solitaire for free!<br><br><b>How to Play Pyramid Solitaire Classic FREE Card Game:</b><br>Pair cards that equal to 13. Jacks = 11, Queens = 12, and Kings = 13. Combine cards totaling 13 to remove them from the board. Use the draw pile to help you find the cards you need. Clear the board to win the game!<br><br>Challenge yourself to reach the top of the Pyramid and clear as many Solitaire boards as possible. Train your brain with this classic Klondike card game. Whether you call it 13 card game, Piramid or Pyramid, it&#39;s our outstanding game that continues to attract millions.<br>Download Pyramid Solitaire by MobilityWare now to play the best and most popular Solitaire card game today!<br><br>Try other card games from our MobilityWare Solitaire Collection: Crown, Castle, Addiction, Spider, FreeCell, TriPeaks Solitaire, and the classic Klondike Solitaire.<br>https://www.mobilityware.com/",
